\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {23}{\ignorespaces Special colour modes. Left: stability$\times $hue (the principal Principia encoding---hue identifies basin identity, darkness marks proximity to binary collision singularities). Centre: direction cosines (each Cartesian component mapped to an RGB channel). Right: spherical harmonic $Y_3^3$ (3-fold symmetry of the equal-mass problem).}}{68}{figure.0.23}\protected@file@percent }
